  "content": "![標誌](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/794741fb947bc376808eddb254e8c0e1bdc17293.png)\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/baercraft\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3988b4778b45b208bc2be116ad9d8a4be4eeba20.png\" alt=\"Discord\" style=\"margin: 10px;\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/subthy\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/55c8a6c5a84a516a90a46291d8c8af15ca50d392.png\" alt=\"Kofi\" style=\"margin: 10px;\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Subthy/Global-Issue-Tracker/issues\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0b69259f6622e76cf20b731a291ca4f761a03ca0.png\" alt=\"Github\" style=\"margin: 10px;\">\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n絨毛夥伴是一款輕量級模組，為所有原版生物以及一些額外生物添加了絨毛玩偶！目前已有超過80款絨毛玩偶，未來還將陸續新增。\n\n**你可能會好奇要如何獲得這些絨毛玩偶？**\n\n要獲得這些可愛的絨毛玩偶，你需要先製作一個縫紉桌，然後就能使用我們的新物品來製作絨毛玩偶。\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n![絨毛玩偶](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/885f8ba829a06f6f26383822cb3f208053ef1db7.png)\n\n![主要感謝名單](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e10106270545ac7bc2e820bfc095177e27f59f96.png)  \n<a href=\"https://8CyhF2.short.gy/5ZfILt\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fb76b2c22f2760c2ff6330c17a841b799fca2442.png\" alt=\"Nog\">\n</a>\n\n![翻譯人員](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d42766eafba74efa016d2c33ca7cdf0c5c7ed98f.png)\n\nNumber_Sir  \n\njunshengxie  \n\n![其他作品](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7ce245ef60a485a17ebe2847f0fcae72ce94e9fa.png)\n\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-cobblemon-tweaks\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/781421b32d925ce3f5afc15e0b77902ca6a6bdc2.png\" alt=\"Cobblemon Tweaks\" style=\"margin: 5px;\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-reclaimed-rocks\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/76add9f6ecdd309d47152b14bda8777bf2e7becd.png\" alt=\"Rocks\" style=\"margin: 5px;\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hammer-havoc\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/332791e16b68fd70c9803cb68eaf98f48ac70e2c.png\" alt=\"Hammer\" style=\"margin: 5px;\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/baercraft\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/01744bca600f3992e4c8c4d86246d261290113f7.png\" alt=\"BaerCraft\" style=\"margin: 5px;\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/trash-panda-craft\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/df40fde3db3a472b2d51181e07a8c9e099ecf92a.png\" alt=\"TPC\" style=\"margin: 5px;\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/pokeasub\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cdf65a57d0338d98199ba19facfd8bfb4a8a9e9a.png\" alt=\"PokeASub\" style=\"margin: 5px;\">\n</a>\n\n<br>\n\n[**![Bisect](https://i.ibb.co/7NW2SY3/8d721697-200b-4168-81cd-f1daa8d8a680.png)**](https://bisecthosting.com/Subthy?r=PlushieBuddies)\n\n</div>",
